[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-midwestern-oil-and-gas-scholarship-2026-27-how-to-apply-99":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},99,"midwestern-oil-and-gas-scholarship-2026-27-how-to-apply-99","Midwestern Oil And Gas Scholarship 2026\u002F27: How To Apply","\u003Cp>The 2025 Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship application is now open for interested and qualified university students.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Midwestern Oil &amp; Gas Ltd\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fnigerian-scholarships\u002F\">Nigerian Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: ₦150,000\u002FYr Till Graduation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Deadline: April 16, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship Benefits and Timeline\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship Award Scheme will give successful candidates a sum of One Hundred and Fifty Thousand Naira (₦150,000) only every year.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The The Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship Award is renewable every year until graduation.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Midwestern Oil and Gas Company Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>UNIVERSITY COMMUNITY AWARD – \u003C\u002Fstrong>For Host Communities Only\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Scholar program listings\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship is open to 100 &amp; 200 level students at the time of application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of 5 Credits in SSCE or GCE including Mathematics &amp; English, in one sitting.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>JAMB\u002FUTME &amp; University admission letter from an accredited\u002Fapproved university in Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Current University ID Card.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Identification letter signed by the Ward Councilor or CACC (Community Accredited Contact-men Committee).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>UNIVERSITY MERIT AWARD\u003C\u002Fstrong> – For Delta State Indigenes Only\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship is open to 200 level students who must have a minimum CGPA of 3.5 at the time of application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Minimum of 5 Credits in SSCE or GCE including Mathematics &amp; English, in one sitting.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>JAMB\u002FUTME &amp; University admission letter from an accredited\u002Fapproved university in Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Current University ID Card.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Cumulative Grade Point Average (CGPA) of his\u002Fher first year in the University (3.5 and above).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Letter of identification from LGA.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>How To Apply for Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Midwestern Oil and Gas Scholarship 2025, follow the steps we have outlined below;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the details we have provided on this website.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the scholarship webpage on Schlastica.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ensure you have met the requirements and gathered the required documents\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on “Apply Now” tab and proceed to “Register Now” to create and activate an account.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Return to the Scholarship site and log in with your registered email and password to upload your information.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Enter your personal information, National Identification Number (if available), educational information, other information and upload the required scanned documents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ensure the name used in applications matches the names on all documentation in the same order. Upload a sworn affidavit or certificate if otherwise.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Ensure you view all documents after uploading, to eliminate errors during uploading.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>When asked to upload photo, upload a passport photograph with a white background.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recheck application information to avoid errors\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Return to “Active Scholarships” and Click on the scheme you wish to apply and Click “Apply Now” to submit information\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>You will receive a notification displayed on the screen and via email that you have successfully applied. To confirm Check “My application” under “My account” section on your profile account.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Only shortlisted candidates will be invited for the proctored computer-based test.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Only successful candidates at each selection stage will be contacted. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcandidate.scholastica.ng\u002Fschemes\u002F2026midwesternmerit\">https:\u002F\u002Fcandidate.scholastica.ng\u002Fschemes\u002F2026midwesternmerit\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-25 10:19:02",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmidwestern-oil-and-gas-scholarship-2026-27-how-to-apply\u002F69c3a8869fafb4.47972953_screenshot 2026-03-25 101046.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmidwestern-oil-and-gas-scholarship-2026-27-how-to-apply\u002F69c3a8869fafb4.47972953_screenshot%202026-03-25%20101046.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[34],{"fileName":35,"oldFileName":35,"type":18,"file":19,"url":36},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":40,"slug":41,"title":42,"images":43,"datePosted":47,"authorName":48},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Scholarship For Foreigners 2026: Fu